  "_note": "Character customization options (PROJECT.md section 5.1). Single source of truth: client/src/profile.ts reads this file. Quaternius characters have their hair baked into the model, so the old hairstyle picker is now a look picker (each look = one model: outfit + hairstyle + face) plus a hair color. 'shirt' lists the model parts (Mesh suffix:Material) tinted with the homeroom color; 'hair' lists the hair materials (first = full hair color, the rest are shaded darker). Mr. Van Diest reviews the final list at Milestone 16. Props (weapons) are hidden in avatar.ts. Swat and Spacesuit models are not offered: their helmets hide the face and skin. hairStyles/facialHair/hats/shoes with a 'donor' borrow that part from another Quaternius model of the same gender ('parts' = Part:Material entries; first hair part gets the full hair color, the others a darker shade). Items with 'proc' are built from simple shapes in accessories.ts.",
